  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, querid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, cuánto me sorprende\nque<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nnos<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nencontremos<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nprecisamente<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naquí.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Qué te parecería si nos batiéramos en un\ncombate Pokémon para mostrarte la alegría<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nque me produce dicho encuentro?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 23,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 222
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te agradezco que te dirijas a mí y que no\nimportunes a mademoiselle Lilette.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¿Iniciamos el combate?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Un momento! Son dos, así que yo le ayudaré\na <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002100200053006F006E00200064006F0073002C00200061007300ED002000710075006500200079006F0020006C0065002000610079007500640061007200E9000A006100200010000201000000002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando estés preparad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, ¡avísame y empezamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750061006E0064006F002000650073007400E9007300200070007200650070006100720061006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002C002000A10061007600ED00730061006D00650020007900200065006D00700065007A0061006D006F00730021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dame un segundo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006D006500200075006E00200073006500670075006E0064006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, ya sé que es todo un poco improvisado.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Cuando te hayas mentalizado para el combate,\nhabla con alguna de ellas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos a demostrarles a estas dos de qué\nestamos hech<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300200061002000640065006D006F00730074007200610072006C006500730020006100200065007300740061007300200064006F007300200064006500200071007500E9000A0065007300740061006D006F00730020006800650063006800100003110000FF0101006F006100730021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, querid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, hazme el favor de\naceptar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmi<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ninvitación.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 15,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tienes todo listo para el combate?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400690065006E0065007300200074006F0064006F0020006C006900730074006F0020007000610072006100200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E0074006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, là, là! ¡Qué atrevimiento hacerme esperar!\nEspero que aceptes cuanto antes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me acompaña Delphi, así que no te quepa\nduda alguna de que obtendremos la victoria.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Decidimos que nos enfrentaremos a ti,\nasí que vete haciendo a la idea.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así me gusta! Me voy a esforzar al máximo\npara complacer a mademoiselle Lilette.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En cuanto termines los preparativos para\nel combate, habla con alguna de ellas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Todos miran y admiran a la estrella que los guía!\n¡Adelante, Clefable!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es hora de sacar a mi as bajo la manga.\n¡Megaevoluciona y dales su merecido, Dragalge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante, Starmie! ¡La pista de baile es tuya!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E00740065002C00200053007400610072006D006900650021002000A1004C00610020007000690073007400610020006400650020006200610069006C0065002000650073002000740075007900610021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Increíble, ¡ganamos, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!\n¡Obtuvimos la victoria!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E00630072006500ED0062006C0065002C002000A100670061006E0061006D006F0073002C002000100002010000000021000A00A1004F00620074007500760069006D006F00730020006C006100200076006900630074006F0072006900610021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No esperaba menos de <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEn cambio, la actuación de tu Starmie me\ndejó anonadada, Adira.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mademoiselle Lilette...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100640065006D006F006900730065006C006C00650020004C0069006C0065007400740065002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quienes practican la danza fortalecen el torso\ny controlan mejor sus movimientos, lo que les<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naporta una sólida base para el combate.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY el talento de un Entrenador se transmite y\nrefleja en las acciones de sus Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 228
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Puedo sugerir que tome lecciones de danza,\nmademoiselle Lilette?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0050007500650064006F00200073007500670065007200690072002000710075006500200074006F006D00650020006C0065006300630069006F006E00650073002000640065002000640061006E007A0061002C000A006D006100640065006D006F006900730065006C006C00650020004C0069006C0065007400740065003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ay... Sabes de sobra que mi sentido del ritmo es\nnulo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410079002E002E002E00200053006100620065007300200064006500200073006F00620072006100200071007500650020006D0069002000730065006E007400690064006F002000640065006C0020007200690074006D006F002000650073000A006E0075006C006F002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo puedo ser su profesora, si así está más\na gusto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059006F00200070007500650064006F0020007300650072002000730075002000700072006F006600650073006F00720061002C00200073006900200061007300ED002000650073007400E10020006D00E10073000A006100200067007500730074006F0021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te agradezco la oferta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400650020006100670072006100640065007A0063006F0020006C00610020006F00660065007200740061002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Acepta tú este humilde presente como símbolo\nde su victoria, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006300650070007400610020007400FA00200065007300740065002000680075006D0069006C00640065002000700072006500730065006E0074006500200063006F006D006F0020007300ED006D0062006F006C006F000A0064006500200073007500200076006900630074006F007200690061002C00200010000201000000002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recibiste el Vestido de Lilette.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006300690062006900730074006500200065006C0020005600650073007400690064006F0020006400650020004C0069006C0065007400740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡¿<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> y mademoiselle Lilette con\nla misma<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nropa?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEstá claro que en esta dimensión pueden suceder\ncosas muy inesperadas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si la Lilette de la otra dimensión está preocupada\npor su falta de ritmo, supongo que lo mismo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nocurrirá en nuestro mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siempre evito bailar en público en la medida\nde lo posible.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690065006D00700072006500200065007600690074006F0020006200610069006C0061007200200065006E0020007000FA0062006C00690063006F00200065006E0020006C00610020006D00650064006900640061000A006400650020006C006F00200070006F007300690062006C0065002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Disfruto mucho de la danza, así que yo estaría\nencantada de enseñarle a mademoiselle Lilette.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    }
